1. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
Plot RPM, speed, and engine load over time.

Analyze acceleration and deceleration patterns.

Visualize geospatial movement using GPS data on a map.

Study gear-shifting behavior using RPM + speed.

🧪 Result: Insights into driving behavior, vehicle performance under different conditions.

🔍 2. Driver Behavior Profiling
Identify driving styles: aggressive vs. smooth driving.

Extract features like:

Number of harsh brakes/accelerations

Speeding patterns

RPM peaks and durations

🧪 Result: Classify trips by driver or driving style (can help in fleet management or insurance).

📈 3. Fuel Efficiency Estimation
Estimate fuel consumption (using proxy variables like RPM, engine load, throttle position).

Correlate driving behavior with estimated fuel usage.

🧪 Result: Identify what kind of driving increases fuel consumption.

🧭 4. Route Optimization & Mapping
Plot vehicle GPS coordinates to reconstruct paths.

Analyze:

Time spent idling

Speed on different road segments

Time per trip

🧪 Result: Build basic navigation analytics or route optimization suggestions.

⚠️ 5. Fault Detection & Diagnostics (Predictive Maintenance)
Detect anomalies in:

RPM fluctuation

Engine load vs. speed

Temperature sensors

Train a simple anomaly detection model (e.g. Isolation Forest, Autoencoder)

🧪 Result: Early warning system for engine/motor issues.

🤖 6. Machine Learning Models (Optional)
Classification: Predict driving condition (city, highway) based on telemetry.

Regression: Predict future RPM/speed or estimate trip time.

Clustering: Group driving sessions by similarity (unsupervised).

🧪 Result: Smart analytics dashboards or intelligent alerts.

